<title>POLAND: NFI Magna Polonia nets PLN 4.8 mln H1.</title>
<headline>NFI Magna Polonia nets PLN 4.8 mln H1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund (NFI) Magna Polonia (No. 6) preliminary results for the first half of 1997, in millions of zlotys:</p>
<p>					H1 1997		   H1 1996</p>
<p>  Net profit			  4.81		     37.35 loss</p>
<p>  Investment portfolio	  336.93		    338.56</p>
<p>  Liabilities and provisions   28.20			8.37</p>
<p>  Net assets			330.63		    330.74</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 10.66			9.45</p>
<p>NOTE: The full company name is Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny Magna Polonia SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
